    "\n",
    "- The OLS estimator $\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}} = (\\mathbf{X}^\\top\\mathbf{X})^{-1}\\mathbf{X}^\\top\\mathbf{y}$ is derived by minimising RSS, and exists uniquely when $\\mathbf{X}$ has full column rank.\n",
